(text "Low-noise postregulators / three output rails" (at 16 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "61d73d9f-e41d-5d87-a8de-7d991302e813"))
(text "Positive LDO VFB=1.185 V; negative LDO VFB=-1.176 V (not the headline reference values).\nNegative IN and EN connect to PRE_N; GND and exposed pad stay at 0 V. All capacitors here are non-polar MLCC.\n10uF outputs must retain >=2.2uF under bias. 10nF NR/SS + feedforward: verify overshoot and startup on bench.\nDiodes bypass reverse differential and clamp wrong-polarity excursions, NOT precise output overvoltage protection." (at 16 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "5a1afc21-8def-53e0-97c7-2c8642486d22"))
